      "x": 340,
      "y": 812,
      "width": 757.02,
      "height": 27.5,
      "text": "Crosses the line:  the user's constraints · one question at a time · a yes or a no · three options with reasons\nNever crosses:  the other 38 restaurants · the filtering · the scores · API calls and technical errors",
      "originalText": "Crosses the line:  the user's constraints · one question at a time · a yes or a no · three options with reasons\nNever crosses:  the other 38 restaurants · the filtering · the scores · API calls and technical errors",
