      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 900,
      "width": 773.76,
      "height": 30,
      "text": "From A1:  A1 decided which factors to ask about (craving, vibe) and which the app should just know\n(distance, opening hours, price). That split is Stage 1 — the app knows the factual ones and never asks.",
